legend top right
  | <ALREADY_IMPLEMENTED_COLOR> | Already Implemented |
  | <REIMPLEMENT_COLOR>         | Reimplement     |
  | <PLANNED_COLOR>             | Planned             |
  | <MAYBE_IN_FUTURE_COLOR>     | Maybe In Future     |
endlegend

' Catalog Records

actor System
actor CatalogRecordsReviewer
actor Admin

Curator <|-- CatalogRecordsReviewer
Curator <|-- Admin

package "Catalog Record Operations" {
    usecase "Get catalog record" as CR1 <<Already Implemented>>
    usecase "Compare catalog records" as CR2 <<Reimplement>>
    usecase "Search saved catalog records" as CR3 <<Already Implemented>>
    usecase "Approve difference" as CR4 <<Already Implemented>>
    usecase "Rescind difference approval" as CR5 <<Already Implemented>>
    usecase "Set up auto-approve for specific difference categories" as CR6 <<Planned>>
    usecase "Decline digitalization from specific record" as CR7 <<Planned>>
    usecase "Cancel declination of digitization" as CR8 <<Planned>>
    usecase "Run tasks on catalog records" as CR9 <<Already Implemented>>
}

package "Catalog Records Lists" {
    usecase "Manage catalog record lists" as CR10 <<Planned>>
    usecase "Assign lists to users" as CR11 <<Planned>>
    usecase "Notify users via email or in-app when list changes" as CR12 <<Planned>>
}

System --> CR1
System --> CR2
System --> CR12

Curator --> CR3

CatalogRecordsReviewer --> CR4
CatalogRecordsReviewer --> CR5
CatalogRecordsReviewer --> CR7
CatalogRecordsReviewer --> CR8
CatalogRecordsReviewer --> CR9
CatalogRecordsReviewer --> CR10
CatalogRecordsReviewer --> CR11

Admin --> CR6

